    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an interesting block-shooting game where you increase your weapon count by defeating circles. When you reach the maximum of three circles, you can combine and upgrade your weapon. This upgrade enhances shooting speed, increases the number of bullets fired, and changes the color of the weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich progression system and challenging gameplay with two different game modes, allowing you to challenge your highest score.</p>",
